# FoundryScript Expert

This repo is the **FoundryScript VS Code extension**
([cafecito-games/Foundry-Scripting](https://github.com/cafecito-games/Foundry-Scripting)).

Before implementing or reviewing changes, read and follow:

`.cursor/skills/foundryscript-expert/SKILL.md`

Load reference files from that skill directory when the task touches:

- **TypeScript** → `references/typescript.md` (strict mode, Vitest, `Result<T,E>`)
- **VS Code extension** → `references/vscode-extension.md` (LSP client, contributes, grammar tests)
- **FoundryScript language** → `references/foundryscript-language.md`; authoritative grammar in [cafecito-games/Foundry `GRAMMAR.md`](https://github.com/cafecito-games/Foundry/blob/develop/modules/foundry_script/GRAMMAR.md)

## Non-negotiables

- Only `src/client/` owns LSP transport; route diagnostics through `src/diagnostics/`
- Match existing module patterns; minimize scope; colocate `*.test.ts`
- Verify with `npm run build && npm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm test`
- Grammar assertions use fully-qualified scopes; `#` lines start at column 1

See `AGENTS.md` for repo layout and verification commands.
